om;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Pretendard;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="260" y="246" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="500" y="246" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="104" value="휴게소 매핑(service_area_stations) · 충전기 마지막 상태 (최근 성공 회차)" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Pretendard;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="500" y="286" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="740" y="286" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="105" value="충전기 목록 + 회차 시각" style="dashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Pretendard;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="740" y="326" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="500" y="326" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="106" value="노선 붙은 곳: 표준데이터 휴게소(방향별)로 statId 묶음 · 표준데이터 좌표&lt;br&gt;못 붙인 곳: statId 하나씩 (노선 필드 null)" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=46;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Pretendard;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="500" y="366" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="500" y="398" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="540" y="366"/><mxPoint x="540" y="398"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="107" value="HD 짝이 있는 HY E-pit(이중 등록 19곳) 빼기 (#217)&lt;br&gt;상태 매핑 · 사용 가능 대수 · statusCounts · 시도(regionCode)" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=46;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Pretendard;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="500" y="428" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="500" y="450" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="540" y="428"/><mxPoint x="540" y="450"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="108" value="200 OK serviceAreas + updatedAt · dataQualit